SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The uuttiimmeess() function is expected to conform to X/Open Portability Guide
     Issue 4, Version 2 (“XPG4.2”).  The ffuuttiimmeessaatt() system call follows The
     Open Group Extended API Set 2 specification but was replaced by
     uuttiimmeennssaatt() in IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The uuttiimmeess() system call appeared in 4.2BSD.  The ffuuttiimmeess() and lluuttiimmeess()
     system calls first appeared in FreeBSD 3.0.  The ffuuttiimmeessaatt() system call
     appeared in FreeBSD 8.0.

